# Dice Roller App

## Project Overview
Dice Roller is a basic Android application developed using Flutter and Android Studio. It allows users to roll a virtual dice and view the result on the screen.

## Features
- Simple and user-friendly interface.
- Virtual dice rolling functionality.
- Displays dice results.
- Interactive application design.

## Technologies Used
- **Flutter** – Application development framework.
- **Dart** – Programming language.
- **Android Studio** – Development environment.

## Project Documentation
The project documentation PDF is included in this repository.

## Project Type
Academic Android Development Project.

